  "goodToKnow": "Die Kundschaft is the clientele, all the customers collectively: eine anspruchsvolle Kundschaft, Stammkundschaft (regulars). It's increasingly used as a gender-neutral alternative to Kunden und Kundinnen, for example on signs: Liebe Kundschaft. Der Kunde (weak noun: den Kunden) is a single customer. Der Kundendienst is customer service. Der Kundschafter is an old word for scout or spy. It has no plural."
